{"title": "Restore Vitality", "pageid": 15025, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Restore_Vitality", "categories": ["Spells", "Level 3 Spells", "Evocation spells", "Bonus actions", "Sources of healing"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Restore_Vitality.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Restore_Vitality.webp/300px-Restore_Vitality.webp, /w/images/9/96/Restore_Vitality.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/96/Restore_Vitality.webp/300px-Restore_Vitality.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/96/Restore_Vitality.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure><b>Restore Vitality </b> is a <a href=\"/wiki/Spells\" title=\"Spells\">level 3 evocation spell</a>. It is a situational spell granted upon casting <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warden_of_Vitality\" title=\"Warden of Vitality\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp/20px-Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp/30px-Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp/40px-Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warden of Vitality\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp/20px-Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warden_of_Vitality\" title=\"Warden of Vitality\">Warden of Vitality</a> that heals the caster or an ally with just the use of a <span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/35px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/46px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/23px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a>.\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\nUse a bonus action to heal yourself or a nearby ally.<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Properties\"> Properties </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dl><dt>Cost</dt>\n<dd><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/42px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png/28px-Bonus_Action_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c9/Bonus_Action_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Resources\" title=\"Actions\">Bonus Action</a></dd><dt>Healing: 2~12</dt><dd class=\"bg3wiki-damage-display\" style=\"margin-left:0px\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;width:fit-content\"><span style=\"display:block;position:relative;width:30px;height:30px;margin-left:0px;padding-top:0px;margin-right:2px\"><span style=\"z-index:0;position:absolute;transform:translate( 0%, 0%)\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/27px-D6_Healing.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/40px-D6_Healing.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/54px-D6_Healing.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/D6_Healing.png/27px-D6_Healing.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"27\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/D6_Healing.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><div><div style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">2d6</span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/30px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/40px-Healing_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Healing\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png/20px-Healing_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ac/Healing_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Healing\" title=\"Healing\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-healing\">Healing</span></a></div></div></div></dd>\n<dt>Details</dt>\n<dd><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/38px-Range_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Range: 9 m (30 ft)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/08/Range_Icon.png/25px-Range_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/0/08/Range_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> Range: 9 m (30 ft)</dd></dl>\n</div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"At_higher_levels\"> At higher levels </span></h2>\n<p>Casting this spell at a higher level grants no additional benefit. </p>\n<div class=\"noexcerpt mw-collapsed mw-collapsible nomobile\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Technical_details\">Technical details <span class=\"mw-collapsible-toggle-placeholder\"></span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible-content\"><div style=\"display: flex\">\n  <div><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico stats.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> UID</div>\n  <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: min-content auto; grid-gap: 6px; margin-left: 6px;\">  \n  <code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\" style=\"margin:0 0 auto\">Target_AuraOfVitality_Activate</code><div><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_AuraOfVitality_Activate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:Target_AuraOfVitality_Activate\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></div>\n  </div>\n</div><div style=\"display: flex; margin-top: 12px\">\n  <div style=\"margin-right:6px\"><span style=\"white-space:nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/38px-Ico_Report.webp 1.5x, /w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ico Report.webp\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/88/Ico_Report.webp/25px-Ico_Report.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/8/88/Ico_Report.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Spell flags</span></div>\n  <div><code><a href=\"/wiki/Temporary_(spell_flag)\" title=\"Temporary (spell flag)\">Temporary</a></code></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by spells:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Warden_of_Vitality\" title=\"Warden of Vitality\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp/25px-Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp/38px-Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp/50px-Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Warden of Vitality\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp/25px-Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/0b/Warden_of_Vitality_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Warden_of_Vitality\" title=\"Warden of Vitality\">Warden of Vitality</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This action is not technically a spell as it lacks the <code><a href=\"/wiki/IsSpell_(spell_flag)\" title=\"IsSpell (spell flag)\">IsSpell</a></code> flag. As such, it will not interact with spell-specific effects such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/30px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/40px-Counterspell_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Counterspell\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp/20px-Counterspell_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/50/Counterspell_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Counterspell\" title=\"Counterspell\">Counterspell</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Metamagic\" title=\"Metamagic\">Metamagic</a>, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Magic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2a/Wild_Magic_passive_feature_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Magic_(passive_feature)\" title=\"Wild Magic (passive feature)\">Wild Magic</a>, etc. However, <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Disciple_of_Life\" title=\"Disciple of Life\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Disciple_of_Life_Icon.webp/20px-Disciple_of_Life_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Disciple_of_Life_Icon.webp/30px-Disciple_of_Life_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Disciple_of_Life_Icon.webp/40px-Disciple_of_Life_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Disciple of Life\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Disciple_of_Life_Icon.webp/20px-Disciple_of_Life_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Disciple_of_Life_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Disciple_of_Life\" title=\"Disciple of Life\">Disciple of Life</a> (which normally only works with spells) is coded to specifically work with this action as well.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715060941\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.075 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3132/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 40888/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 14610/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 24/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.028/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1448151/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   66.483      1